    "name": "Hoard's LLC: Limited Labyrinth Corporation",
    "steam_appid": 3590180,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hoard\u2019s LLC is a cute, story-driven puzzle game where you play as Barry, a mild-mannered minotaur working deep in the depths of a corporate dungeon. When Barry starts to realize his coworkers are being exploited, he sets out to do something truly radical: help them!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590180/extras/acf9b38ea4df6f921fa6dd92968de1ce.avif?t=1752246114\" width=800 height=96 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>What is the most powerful weapon against an evil boss ruling over a dungeon full of monsters? </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>An ancient sword? </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>A magic ring? </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>No!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i> The most powerful spell of all: Unionizing!</i>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590180/extras/69d77b2ddcf01e7a48d4c2df01a054de.avif?t=1752246114\" width=800 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Create a path through the labyrinth:</strong> Navigate a maze of departments\u2014like Loot Logistics and Monster Resources\u2014solving clever puzzles to reconnect isolated coworkers. Rotate tiles to create a path to get Barry to the exit on each level. Avoid spike traps, stone tiles that refuse to budge, and other obstacles.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590180/extras/e8e54563e962a932a2be8594b08ca2e5.poster.avif?t=1752246114\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590180/extras/e8e54563e962a932a2be8594b08ca2e5.webm?t=1752246114\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590180/extras/e8e54563e962a932a2be8594b08ca2e5.mp4?t=1752246114\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Experience visual novel storytelling:</strong> Uncover endearing stories, roll eyes at cheesy corporate humor, and bring together a community that needs each other now more than ever.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590180/extras/82c76456adad6af150391e79abc74973.avif?t=1752246114\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Master the dungeon:</strong> Replay levels to find the optimal path to success!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590180/extras/7021b897350856b32171260482c8fa03.avif?t=1752246114\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hoard\u2019s LLC is a cute, story-driven puzzle game where you play as Barry, a mild-mannered minotaur working deep in the depths of a corporate dungeon. When Barry starts to realize his coworkers are being exploited, he sets out to do something truly radical: help them!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590180/extras/acf9b38ea4df6f921fa6dd92968de1ce.avif?t=1752246114\" width=800 height=96 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>What is the most powerful weapon against an evil boss ruling over a dungeon full of monsters? </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>An ancient sword? </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>A magic ring? </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>No!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i> The most powerful spell of all: Unionizing!</i>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590180/extras/69d77b2ddcf01e7a48d4c2df01a054de.avif?t=1752246114\" width=800 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Create a path through the labyrinth:</strong> Navigate a maze of departments\u2014like Loot Logistics and Monster Resources\u2014solving clever puzzles to reconnect isolated coworkers. Rotate tiles to create a path to get Barry to the exit on each level. Avoid spike traps, stone tiles that refuse to budge, and other obstacles.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590180/extras/e8e54563e962a932a2be8594b08ca2e5.poster.avif?t=1752246114\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590180/extras/e8e54563e962a932a2be8594b08ca2e5.webm?t=1752246114\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590180/extras/e8e54563e962a932a2be8594b08ca2e5.mp4?t=1752246114\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Experience visual novel storytelling:</strong> Uncover endearing stories, roll eyes at cheesy corporate humor, and bring together a community that needs each other now more than ever.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590180/extras/82c76456adad6af150391e79abc74973.avif?t=1752246114\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Master the dungeon:</strong> Replay levels to find the optimal path to success!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590180/extras/7021b897350856b32171260482c8fa03.avif?t=1752246114\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "Hoard\u2019s LLC is a cute puzzle game where you rotate dungeon tiles, dodge workplace hazards (and spike traps!), and help Barry build a community one monster at a time. Corporate policy says &quot;avoid unnecessary cross-departmental entanglements&quot; \u2014Barry says &quot;maybe it's time to unionize.&quot;",
